[{"title":"同杨应先朱瞻御梁喈林集程散木中秘园亭用瞻御韵","author":"李之世","text":"冥濛香径滑，澹雨洒林扃。\n侵晓方趋省，留宾暂憩亭。\n花明仙掌露，草带凤池青。\n胜念堪留记，浮踪几聚萍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27096,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过御空上人兰若留题","author":"李之世","text":"新草上阶绿，禅房花木妍。\n十年重到此，一榻尚依然。\n鸟语过林滑，经声绕竹圆。\n却怜尘网系，归棹寺门前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27097,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将北征上侍御老师 其一","author":"李之世","text":"寒灯灿幽馆，永夜对沈沈。\n政有长途役，难忘迟暮心。\n宵钟清远寺，凉露澹疏林。\n惜别徒劳念，因风寄短吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27098,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将北征上侍御老师 其二","author":"李之世","text":"自怜甘懒拙，飒沓误儒冠。\n短剑空存铗，敝裘宁耐寒。\n戒途犹渺渺，顾径且盘盘。\n即未离乡井，已怀行路难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27099,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将北征上侍御老师 其三","author":"李之世","text":"行藏俱莫问，难报是君亲。\n风木馀双泪，驱驰剩一身。\n半生焚砚债，未老倦游人。\n时事方蒿目，聊容招隐沦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27100,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将北征上侍御老师 其四","author":"李之世","text":"尘劳真梦梦，四十未知非。\n觉路瞻犹远，空门暂可依。\n戒香莲漏永，清梵宝林微。\n胜地此为别，长谣始愿违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27101,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将北征上侍御老师 其五","author":"李之世","text":"严程八千里，北极是京华。\n藿食犹怀阙，林栖岂恋家。\n卖琴充橐俭，策蹇问途赊。\n赖有连枝伴，休怜天一涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27102,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上","author":"李之世","text":"空江望不极，长天净碧漪。\n客心聊共远，江路浩难期。\n霜叶纷辞树，流莺未上枝。\n及早还乡井，芳菲正此时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27103,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过十八滩","author":"李之世","text":"沙堰船难进，前滩浪复高。\n客心殊已倦，舟子亦云劳。\n阴碛走万马，冲风度一毛。\n往来不及瞬，慎勿弄轻篙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27104,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道士山房","author":"李之世","text":"结庐在山顶，高高傍斗坛。\n夜来风飘瓦，吹雪满霞冠。\n汲泉留洗药，养火为烧丹。\n怕有俗人溷，书符贴板门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27105,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谭与人过访舟次因留小酌遂拉同舟","author":"李之世","text":"以我乡愁剧，逢君旅思新。\n同为羁病客，堪作并舟人。\n草碧故山路，梅残陇首春。\n孤蓬随飘往，尊酒话情亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27106,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭吴非熊","author":"李之世","text":"徒云归是客，难道客如归。\n易篑僮先散，招魂谁可依。\n来惊春浪阔，去及柳条稀。\n迢递黄山路，程程入翠微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27107,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠逆旅主人","author":"李之世","text":"主人忘世味，雅志在林园。\n如何市朝隐，不避车马喧。\n相逢具鸡黍，佐茗儗清言。\n挥手自兹去，前途风雪繁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27108,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西江晚泛因怀邓梁二山人","author":"李之世","text":"西江何清浅，回合卓冈岑。\n虽自非吾土，依然生远心。\n予徒牵物役，尔辈足山林。\n倘许从初服，薜萝春正深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27109,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈冶父还清远","author":"李之世","text":"冻雪何霏霏，严寒透衲衣。\n故山频入梦，残腊始言归。\n末路交情见，长年游道非。\n携将春草色，还以献慈闱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27110,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望圭峰寄道人","author":"李之世","text":"乱壑在深翠，禅关不上扃。\n衣裁云叶白，座藉草盘青。\n施食鸟无怖，驮经虎有灵。\n更疑说法处，或者老猿听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27111,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜答梁天放","author":"李之世","text":"夜窗谁共语，清对短檐松。\n月浸一池水，风飘何处钟。\n寒知天边雁，秋入壁间蛩。\n两地俱摇落，怀君隔几重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27112,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得南海刘方瀛老师书辄赋一律奉答","author":"李之世","text":"珠江望不极，晴色霭氤氲。\n万里看明月，相思隔暮云。\n花间琴自远，桑下雉为群。\n想像弦歌处，微茫一水分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27113,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别李干甫","author":"李之世","text":"嗟君不得意，湖海事遨游。\n夜雨双龙剑，寒江一叶舟。\n澹云孤雁杳，芳树晚风柔。\n别后看明月，相思漫倚楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27114,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"席间赠黄达卿","author":"李之世","text":"风流谁藉甚，闽海有狂生。\n白眼逢人态，黄金结客情。\n诗篇行处满，世事酒中轻。\n若问赢输理，相看一局枰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27115,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夕叶而章过饮小园有赠","author":"李之世","text":"槐竹互参差，窥林得月迟。\n閒庭青霭合，荒径碧苔滋。\n浊酒汎篱菊，清霜摘野葵。\n相逢无约束，潦倒是襟期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27116,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过庐陵谒萧拙修太史","author":"李之世","text":"暂尔还初服，鸿冥亦可仪。\n登堂今日再，倾盖昔年知。\n天岂虚麟凤，人其閟鼎彝。\n赐还当此际，行矣赴昌期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27117,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访王君奉于德兴寺留题","author":"李之世","text":"虽游京国遍，而独爱禅居。\n柿叶留僧偈，莲花借佛炉。\n空床储腊酒，高庋顿奇书。\n客况无聊赖，思君便策驴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27118,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓行河间道中","author":"李之世","text":"晓行三十里，白雾尚冥冥。\n沾洒俄成霰，微茫不辨星。\n马寒嘶欲止，车滑去难停。\n隐约见篱舍，疏烟出过坰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27119,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别广文邓先生","author":"李之世","text":"绛帐横经日，黄云接袂时。\n春光如有待，花雨本无私。\n桃李沾前润，风云想后期。\n重游惜分手，南陌柳丝丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27120,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"区彦斯茂对君玉携酒过中林访平子","author":"李之世","text":"故人载酒至，石榻一开樽。\n访友来蒿径，课吟傍竹垣。\n庭兰芳气合，阶树野禽喧。\n值此秋光好，乘閒共晤言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27121,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同平子君玉玩月","author":"李之世","text":"中秋悬雨夕，月色可能同。\n素魄微亏晕，流光澹写空。\n连溪蘸一碧，鉴叶皎千丛。\n清景谁延赏，高台习习风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27122,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阶前树","author":"李之世","text":"嘉树发芳蕤。\n亭亭复在兹。\n年深霜藓剥，根古石文移。\n寒影半栖壁，凉蟾来挂枝。\n谁人解幽赏，只是爱华滋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27123,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜邢耿乃林学仲同舟赋赠","author":"李之世","text":"家乡南极尽，去路与天长。\n各自携孤剑，相将上野航。\n扬舲遵水次，欣月挹山光。\n且喜偕心赏，计程未觉忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27124,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊梁口","author":"李之世","text":"寒沙一片白，澹月带霜痕。\n舟子乍停桨，人家半掩门。\n疏烟衔落木，微火辨遥村。\n暂觉离乡远，江干劳梦魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27125,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过明因寺看如来成道碑","author":"李之世","text":"已讶鱼知乐，因寻僧伴閒。\n问途经水次，礼磬入云间。\n到此偶成趣，逾时忘却还。\n如来有遗记，胜会想灵山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27126,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浴象 其一","author":"李之世","text":"译贡来何域，香刍饲一栏。\n班行随肃卫，厮养属酋官。\n剪拂添光采，梳爬绝垢瘢。\n渡河闻内典，今见戏清澜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27127,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浴象 其二","author":"李之世","text":"羲驭当炎候，天閒放浴晨。\n魁梧看若辈，豢养几经春。\n骑出人争拥，调来性已驯。\n应沾新雨露，天子祷郊频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27128,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浴象 其三","author":"李之世","text":"且自辞天仗，群趋向禁壕。\n乍泅波欲黑，对立岸难高。\n鹓鹭陪曾惯，熊罴气并豪。\n年年当此际，湔刷圉人劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27129,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浴象 其四","author":"李之世","text":"出入随宫禁，烟波沐主恩。\n雄堪为兽长，慧亦解人言。\n辇道行犹窄，长河搅欲浑。\n画桥垂柳外，观者驻游轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27130,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浴象 其五","author":"李之世","text":"浴罢更昂藏，溅珠满地凉。\n归朝添渥泽，散步有辉光。\n鼻划荷筒捲，牙垂藕笋长。\n遥看真可讶，修影出城墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27131,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浴象 其六","author":"李之世","text":"纵然生佛国，何似集王家。\n竹削四蹄稳，棱分两目斜。\n沈疑山落影，喷亦雪飘花。\n会向尧阶舞，时清不触邪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27132,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同杨应先朱瞻御梁喈林集程散木中秘园亭用瞻御韵","author":"李之世","text":"画阑藏宛转，芳树互周遮。\n斲石片云坠，移筠万玉斜。\n浓分宫苑柳，艳缀海榴花。\n时复清吟罢，玄言共啜茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27133,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜 其一","author":"李之世","text":"微雨忽入户，夏云涵暝光。\n经旬苦毒热，兹夜浴浮凉。\n旅食矜珠桂，乡愁问稔荒。\n胡为空役役，终日尚名缰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27134,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜 其二","author":"李之世","text":"从来蓟北地，多旱少愁淋。\n残溽蒸成雨，微云荡作阴。\n就凉方徙榻，泛爽最宜琴。\n自觉身无累，悠悠此夜心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27135,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜 其三","author":"李之世","text":"夜长睡可厌，暑雨快何如。\n懒是生来骨，穷留著就书。\n一灯清漏下，数杵寺钟馀。\n萧爽还如昼，纸窗流影虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27136,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜 其四","author":"李之世","text":"密云舒又合，雨色尚徘徊。\n减膳皇仁渥，升庖国禁开。\n微沾宣久郁，薄怒示轻雷。\n天意难应问，终宵首重回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27137,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜 其五","author":"李之世","text":"明明真宰意，嘿以示禨祥。\n夜久炎如洗，听残喜若狂。\n清时无害马，天怒在宏羊。\n甘澍应如此，欢呼走成方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27138,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜 其六","author":"李之世","text":"昨有传来信，江关弄甲兵。\n人皆数粒粟，野有揭竿行。\n夜梦亲儿女，乡书隔友生。\n南中天泽远，应不比京城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27139,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何卜熙刺史过馆话别兼赠以诗即席奉答","author":"李之世","text":"君今五马贵，犹说宦情难。\n况我垂双鬓，经年博一官。\n关山行役苦，雨雪去途寒。\n赖有临岐赠，芳词吐若兰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27140,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜次大通滘","author":"李之世","text":"风便船弥进，中宵尚促程。\n一帆江雾重，几片雪灯明。\n邮馆风传柝，官艘夜点兵。\n畏途频命旅，息桨待潮行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27141,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄舍弟","author":"李之世","text":"吾侪二三子，大半不逢时。\n暂戢飞腾翼，谁图丘壑姿。\n生涯七寸管，旧业一茆茨。\n出处元同调，栖迟得并枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27142,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜起读陈子明诗","author":"李之世","text":"终夜不成寐，披衣检旧编。\n遐哉千古事，作者几人焉。\n草昧凡三变，精华或一宣。\n看君饶著述，他日必能传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27143,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过潘元明静适堂留题","author":"李之世","text":"市朝空役役，此地得真如。\n竹影苔痕合，庭阴日色虚。\n频来非问字，凭几共观鱼。\n啜茗无馀事，焚香读古书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27144,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"李之世","text":"耿耿达长夜，悠悠逼岁除。\n时序不相待，头颅变故吾。\n生涯看潦倒，礼法任粗疏。\n即此销馀日，千秋将焉如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27145,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访梁孝廉","author":"李之世","text":"金鸡下紫宸。\n寒谷暗生春。\n白发悲游子，丹风度逐臣。\n曝背思明主，过庭傍老亲。\n图书四壁在，知尔未全贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27146,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余方谢客而顺德黄功治邓尔师来访开户延之赋赠二律 其一","author":"李之世","text":"经秋无一事，结束类枯禅。\n药草罗清供，香花礼法筵。\n闭门辞问字，高枕咏残编。\n有客来相过，言寻静者缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27147,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余方谢客而顺德黄功治邓尔师来访开户延之赋赠二律 其二","author":"李之世","text":"幽居惟水竹，息影绝纷呶。\n得尔素心侣，真成把臂交。\n一瓢常挂树，三径自诛茆。\n从此忘来去，蓬门可任敲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27148,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋雨园居容九闳过访留酌 其一","author":"李之世","text":"颓垣经雨塌，编棘故尝籓。\n弱卉斜穿格，垂萝袅荫门。\n茶炉置竹脚，药白倚忪根。\n晴有高人过，琴书共晤言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27149,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋雨园居容九闳过访留酌 其二","author":"李之世","text":"微雨飒沓过，凉飔透薄帘。\n侵阶时沥沥，映草复纤纤。\n谑语堪成韵，轻杯剧可拈。\n飞腾君自爱，吾著老夫潜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27150,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林阳仲容九闳过饮凤城旅馆","author":"李之世","text":"倦游无岁月，可似滞周南。\n客计穷相傍，乡愁酒共酣。\n时名骄白眼，世路误青衫。\n牢落归何晚，徒令短铗惭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27151,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝载山房同诸子话别","author":"李之世","text":"见棹迟明发，移尊话竹林。\n别离何必远，去住此时心。\n作客恬乡梦，因君动苦吟。\n刺桐花下月，且与坐更深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27152,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三夜","author":"李之世","text":"未觉清晖满，还惊皓魄流。\n夜凉清似水，云澹曲如钩。\n雁影冲寒塞，砧声起暮潮。\n孤城一长望，萧飒总悲秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27153,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四夜","author":"李之世","text":"素月净明漪，危桥清眺时。\n带星光沥沥，蘸水流澌澌。\n岸火行相引，渔舟望屡移。\n严城不禁夜，玉漏正迟迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27154,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五夜","author":"李之世","text":"暝色澹城烟。\n中天一镜悬。\n薄云微点缀，清影斗弹娟。\n狼籍传杯斝，纵横列几筵。\n酒阑兴未已，南陌共翩翩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27155,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同梁伯静舍弟文度送吴彦先于东郊赋别","author":"李之世","text":"黯黯那能别，尊前不尽欢。\n日色晓衔阁，岚光晴度峦。\n起看江上影，遥挂片帆端。\n欲发频维棹，偏怜此际难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27156,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴德祖还新安","author":"李之世","text":"山山黄叶积，之子汎归舟。\n邂逅成今昔，存亡念旧游。\n岭云微带雨，江树远含秋。\n惆怅西风道，茫茫起旅愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27157,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水松","author":"李之世","text":"只讶移峰岭，谁知产污坭。\n傍柳还垂岸，非桃亦占溪。\n照水笼鳞现，翻波麈尾齐。\n欲搆茅龛住，怜君在瀼西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27158,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"翠鸟","author":"李之世","text":"委毳人争惜，微躯混野蒿。\n衔鱼冲水入，避缴掠林豪。\n岂不矜文藻，何惭借羽毛。\n山鸡频照影，顾盼亦云劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27159,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯","author":"李之世","text":"孤光唯一点，清迥若含情。\n喜送红珠润，残添碧晕生。\n虚晖涵室白，纤隙借邻明。\n独有寒襟影，侵人梦不成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27160,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺阁灯","author":"李之世","text":"珠蕊寒难结，兰膏淡不辉。\n情因妮独夜，欢恐夺朝晖。\n暧暧送宵梦，澄澄鉴薄帏。\n几回羞对影，背立换罗衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27161,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禅室灯","author":"李之世","text":"已知光是幻，难道照非缘。\n灭尽归何处，将残续有权。\n分能千百影，聚亦往来烟。\n此际原无著，聊凭膏火传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27162,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佛灯","author":"李之世","text":"含灵都向晦，寂照一龛中。\n色岂无常幻，光原不住空。\n日月灯皆佛，山河影尽同。\n静看轮转内，于此悟无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27163,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔灯","author":"李之世","text":"萧萧芦苇岸，点点似流萤。\n澹影摇细浪，微光缀曙星。\n鱼方思浩荡，鹤或惊空冥。\n不是燃犀照，深潭聚百灵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27164,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村灯","author":"李之世","text":"远火明长薄，孤村欲暝时。\n人声在篱落，花影宿茆茨。\n犬猎遥归垄，鸡栖尽上枝。\n田家多夜作，腰斧斫松脂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27165,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]